"<!doctype html>
<html lang=\"sr\">
<head>
<meta charset=\"utf-8\">
<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">
<title>VICE GRID '98 — Deluxe Edition</title>
<style>
@page {
    size: A4 landscape;
    margin: 10mm;
    background-color: #080b0e;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #080b0e;
    color: #e9e7dc;
    font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    height: 100vh;
}
#app {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1240px;
    padding: 10px;
}
header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2d3b42;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
}
h1 {
    font-size: 19px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #d8d994;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
}
.hud {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
}
.chip {
    background: #151e24;
    border: 1px solid #3c4e56;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #c5d0d3;
    border-radius: 3px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
}
canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 4px solid #3c4642;
    background: #1b2628;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 50px #000, inset 0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    border-radius: 4px;
}
#bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
}
#mission {
    background: #151e24;
    border-left: 4px solid #d8d994;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #cfd8d6;
}
#help {
    text-align: right;
    color: #899895;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
}
#touch { display:none; position:fixed; inset:auto 12px 14px; z-index:20; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; pointer-events:none; }
.pad { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,48px); grid-template-rows:repeat(2,44px); gap:4px; pointer-events:auto; }
.pad button,.action button { background:#172329dd; color:#f1df84; border:1px solid #8c9a8b; border-radius:6px; padding:0; font-size:17px; touch-action:none; }
.pad button:active,.action button:active { background:#b78c36; color:#101619; }
.pad .empty { visibility:hidden; }
.action { display:flex; gap:7px; pointer-events:auto; }
.action button { width:58px; height:48px; font-size:12px; }
#pause { display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:30; background:#080b0edb; place-items:center; text-align:center; }
#pause .box { background:#151e24; border:2px solid #d8d994; padding:25px 35px; box-shadow:0 12px 40px #000; }
@media (max-width:760px) { body {height:auto; min-height:100dvh; align-items:flex-start;} #app {padding:7px;} header {flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px;} h1 {font-size:14px;} .chip {font-size:10px; padding:4px 6px;} #bottom {grid-template-columns:1fr;} #help {text-align:left;} #touch {display:flex;} canvas {max-height:68vh; object-fit:contain;} }
#toast {
    position: fixed;
    top: 24px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #0d1419;
    border: 2px solid #d8d994;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    display: none;
    z-index: 10;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    border-radius: 4px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id=\"app\">
<header>
    <h1>VICE GRID ’98 <span style=\"color:#7f9094; font-size:14px;\">// 2x SCALE GTA 2 EDITION</span></h1>
    <div class=\"hud\">
        <span class=\"chip\" id=\"cash\">$ 250</span>
        <span class=\"chip\" id=\"time\">08:00</span>
        <span class=\"chip\" id=\"weather\">☀️ SUNNY</span>
        <span class=\"chip\" id=\"wanted\">POLICE ☆☆☆☆☆</span>
    </div>
</header>
<canvas id=\"game\" width=\"1024\" height=\"600\"></canvas>
<div id=\"bottom\">
    <div id=\"mission\"><b style=\"color:#d8d994\">GRADSKI POSAO</b><div id=\"task\">Istražuj grad. Ulice i zgrade su 2x veće!</div></div>
    <div id=\"help\">WASD / strelice — kretanje, vožnja i PLIVANJE · SPACE — ručna / drift<br>E / ENTER —

---
This is a build request. Build a complete, playable game now (or apply the requested change to the existing game). Do not ask clarifying questions; make reasonable assumptions and note them briefly when you finish.

Screenshots for your own checks: save small JPEGs (a .jpg path, viewport at most 1280px wide) and read only the latest one; older images are dropped from context. Read a full-size PNG only when fine detail matters.
"

